@startuml

title The run progress read: the fields a page follows

class "run progress read\n(workflow.v1.instances.steps)" as progress_read <<message>> #E1F5FF {
    {field} +status : state
    {field} +step count : count
    {field} +current step : index
    {field} +step summaries : list
}

class "step summary" as step_summary <<message>> #E1F5FF {
    {field} +name : text
    {field} +state : state
    {field} +error : text
}

progress_read *-- "0..*" step_summary : one summary per step

note top of progress_read
What a page reads to follow a run and render one line per operation.
state status // the run's state: in_progress, completed, failed, compensating or compensated
count step count // how many steps the run declares
index current step // the step the run is executing
list step summaries // one summary for each step
end note

note top of step_summary
What one step of a run reports to the page.
text name // the operation the step performs
state state // the step's own state
text error // what went wrong, where the step failed
end note

@enduml
